{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_07_beg","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_07","title":"乱局","storyCode":"IW-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"527dfb4f60d649237f22f13bd129df5948168ee69df340212b4133317e973f12","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"07上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"......唔。\n头疼头疼......何事如此喧哗......嗯？\n啊......原来是落子声响，叮叮当当。\n棋罢不知人换世，梦醒只道是何年......何年......何年......\n呃......\n......怎么酒又没了。\n这都是何苦呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"尚冢摸了摸脖子上的膏药，这是他的习惯。\n十年如一日地挑起扁担，上山下山，这也是他的习惯。\n取江峰确实很高，很险。高到没有人烟，险到万籁俱寂。\n数不清这是在尚蜀看见的第几个春天，他抬头远眺，只见人踪尽灭的山道那头，有一个人。\n一个他等了很久的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们终于还是再见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方才见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时你没有带刀，就不算见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那现在我带刀来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......话先说明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道错不在你。我也知道，那个雨夜，死的不止是我的儿子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你收养了他的女儿，她现在怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我打算让她接我的班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是打算接镖局的班，还是像你这些年做的，安安分分当个老板娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都行，看她喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找着心上人没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你活不到看她出嫁的那天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许今天我们不用打打杀杀的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，我知道你的为人，你心里有愧，但我心里有怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怨了十年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你一开始就没打算今天赢我。酒楼茶馆客栈，哪一个不都是为了给你的女儿留条退路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道镖局是个得罪人的行当。你也知道，如果你不在了，镖局会是什么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了，你挂刀而去，不守规矩，于情，大家体谅你，可于理，你还是个叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那夜之后，你若是背负着那些罪过，带领镖局继续前行，我又怎么会叛出镖局！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我儿走镖，也是有所觉悟的，我何尝不知？可你的行为，开客栈开餐厅，难道不是践踏他们的死吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你！一蹶不振，逃避过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我是知道的，但咱们话说得有点多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行裕镖局总镖头，问霜客，郑清钺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚家棍，尚冢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"早春，垂暮，树影婆娑，落雪如银。\n一阵风起，一把刀落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你实在是歇息得太久了，郑清钺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......未必是我歇息得久了，也许是你爬山爬得太多，步法又精进了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你这样的英雄好汉，下半辈子却注定无法行走，也实在可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是刀势太快，雪光晃眼，被你稍微擦破裤腿，我就无法行走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一刀，你挡不住。你拿的，毕竟不是家传的宝棍。只是根破木棍罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——爹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿！？你怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然是杜遥夜。转眼间，已经长这么大了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位好闲情，天色渐晚，还有空在这......比武练习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你。你在这里做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞒尚师傅你说，你腰间那只盏，是我一朋友托我寻来的。我要找亭子，也和那只酒盏分不开呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕刀剑无眼，二位切磋之间......误碰了酒盏，得不偿失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，你这是在做什么——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......夜儿，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十年前，行裕镖局接了一单大镖。但是路上遭遇暴雨，在荒野上被土匪袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了保货，郑清钺放弃了同行的镖师，十几个弟兄死于非命，其中有我的儿子，也有你的......亲生父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑清钺见死不救。他不仅见死不救，到头来，他也没把货物保住，没把镖局名声保住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至再后来，他对镖局之落魄视而不见，逃避失败，你知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，你的母亲也离开了尚蜀，回了老家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜遥夜......这些，你当真知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿。这没你的事，爹这就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是......尚师傅吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是叛徒尚冢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为本小姐是什么人？一无所知地像个傻子一样在温室里长大到今天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我亲爹亲娘的事情，我都知道。郑老头这些年做了什么，怎么做的，我比你更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，今天我便是要告诉你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——镖局也好酒馆也罢，迟早是要姓杜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦二老，不要现在给我找麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要是不让开，是要吃苦头的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有话好好说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......铜钱剑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笑话。难道你要在我面前卖弄什么术法不成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，免了免了，我可不是擅长近身战斗的人......只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这玩意，你要便拿去，接着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——休想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑清钺！你还敢分神！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——别对爹出手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，碍事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚冢，你这老糊涂，竟然对晚辈动手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮的一声。\n扁担一撇，压下刀光，可郑清钺的刀，却不可避地偏向了别处。\n而那酒盏又实在是坚硬，若非如此，天底下有什么瓷器，是挨了郑清钺一刀还能完好无损的？\n可是这一刀，却把那只漆黑如夜的酒盏，打飞了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——酒盏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别管我们！忙你的去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是家务事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持一小会，马上就有人来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿，不能让他去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这老匹夫想要你命啊，你还要管那破玩意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜遥夜说得对。十年前，你也是从山崖上弄丢了这只酒盏。如今，再来一次，滋味如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚冢......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我让开，办法简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到此为止！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑前辈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——酒盏被击落山崖，那个龙门人已经去找了，二位，动作快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杜小姐这是做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人和姓鲤的，还有两位看着就不近人情的朝廷特使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总要选边站的，我想通了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我答应过姓鲤的了， 江湖人一诺千金，也是规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜儿！别胡闹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人真多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天本不该来这么多人。但是，无妨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做个了断，有你我就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜小姐，你应该知道我们是秉公办事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看未必有那么“秉公”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就失礼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且慢且慢，这么一个大老爷们，就这么对一个姑娘家出手，不好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——廉家阴晴扇，果然好功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不识抬举。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子，没事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，疼疼疼，竟然能把这么大块石砖随手抛出......真是可怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬酒不吃吃罚酒，无话可说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弩箭！是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里哟。看错方向啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要碍事，兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛是不打算协助司岁台了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也许有你们的道理。但是年和我们相处了很久，我清楚她的为人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兽心难测，为人又算的了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许算不了什么，但起码要算个我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有我。夕小姐点破迷障，也算给了我一记当头棒喝......我这人稍微有点喜欢躲事，不过好就好在，我还是知恩图报的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......廉家阴晴扇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次被你吓着了，不敢动手，这次倒是有机会领教领教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要抢你们的盏，就滚一边儿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只酒盏对镖局意义重大，要是就这么搁置一旁，我和死了有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在本就和死了没什么区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，现在你的眼神才像郑清钺的眼神，是因为女儿在这儿，还是因为镖局颜面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你总算是一个想活下去的人了，这样我们的胜负才有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚冢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是你的儿子在天之灵，知道你今天如此作为，他会高兴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别拿那套话来诓我，他就是活着，站在这儿，他也拦不住他老子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慎师傅，为何在此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那几人送到山顶，我就下山了。想着迟早会遇到梁大人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人不也果真来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过了许久了，我来近处看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那宁小姐那边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"察觉到了，或许一早就察觉到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书房失窃，多半是她的小心思吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还请梁大人劝劝宁小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他几位先不提，那位姓白的老陶工，绝对不能出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白天师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他攥一把天雷洒向人间，就等同司岁台和礼部撕破了脸皮，天师府的一双脚，也不知道站哪儿好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有劳慎师傅操心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我就是个船夫，操什么心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前戍守过几年北疆，天寒地冻没事儿干，就和袍泽弟兄扯些家国大事，聊着玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然大家都是一心向炎，不过些许小事上差之毫厘，大没有必要失之千里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此乃匹夫之责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是匹夫，梁大人也算匹夫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大地厚广，万物自由。普天之下，皆为匹夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......梁大人希望我怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望慎师傅保尚蜀太平。如果最后出了什么岔子......希望慎师傅抢在宁小姐和那五人有所行动之前，先一步息事宁人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有句老话叫作尽人事以待天命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某人从大炎朝堂之上学来的第一句话，便是“天命在人”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
